 it had been created as INC-0001 (SEV2, checkout-api, open). It describes the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and the current state. I did not create a duplicate.\n\nFollow-ups for the team: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure before releasing it again, and look into the orchestrator's partial-failure behavior.", "type": "text"}]}]}